{
  "name": "@agentpm/avatar-worker",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "license": "Apache-2.0",
  "description": "AgentPM PM 替身：定时采集项目状态 → 规则引擎（常开）+ LLM 增强（可选）→ 日报/风险告警。只经 REST 工作，每一步进审计（ADR 0005）。",
